<title>USA: U.S. Conference Board names Gail Fosler Senior VP.</title>
<headline>U.S. Conference Board names Gail Fosler Senior VP.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Conference Board said it named economist Gail Fosler senior vice president.</p>
<p>Fosler will continue as the Conference Board's chief economist, the report said.</p>
<p>She joined the Conference Board in 1989 as head of the economics and business environment group and was named vice president in 1991.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
